Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the default body of the Dual Shade Quick Settings overlay (swipe
down from the top right) with the Budík "Řídicí centrum" from
export/mockups/*/05_quick_settings.png:

- dark sheet (#0E0F11, #17191C with a border in dark mode), 20 dp top
  corners, monospace header "ŘÍDICÍ CENTRUM" with the connected network
  (internet tile) and battery level, drag handle;
- first six tiles as icon keycaps with the label under the key, the rest
  as large keycaps (label inside, icon top right), 4 per row; on = mint
  face with #0E0F11 content, off = light keycap, unavailable = dimmed; no
  key captions (F1, ENTER); last key "Hotovo" (navy) closes the panel;
- segmented brightness slider (20 mint segments + percentage), drag or
  tap, honours the brightness policy restriction; no brightness mirror;
- footer: logo, "Budík OS <version> · <device>", edit / settings / power
  keycaps (edit mode, Settings and the power menu as before).

Tile clicks keep the AOSP semantics (toggle for dual target tiles, long
press for details/settings), tile listening, media, privacy chip, edit
mode and tile details are unchanged. No blur, no extra animations.
